                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Slush is waiting\non the roof, where\nnobody can accuse\nhim of hiding",
                                        "in a room with\nbetter heating. A\nsurvey book lies\nunder his",
                                        "umbrella. He has\nspent years paying\nfor patches while\nthe council",
                                        "argued over whose\npatch mattered\nmost."
